&lt;li&gt;Oversee partner sandbox infrastructure, including ticket coordination, governance, and workspace management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with internal teams for the setup of partner development environments, including SFDC account creation and tenant administration, model copy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Workshop Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the comprehensive preparation for partner on-site workshops, a process requiring multiple hours per event to coordinate all logistical, content-related and training instance aspects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Sales Certification Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the backlog of candidates for the pre-sales certification program, conducting prerequisite checks to ensure candidate readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule and coordinate all required workshop sessions, rehearsals, and assessments with internal stakeholders and partner-facing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3-5 years of experience in managing Anaplan instances, model copy, tenant administration. Anaplan Certified Professional&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3-5 years of experience in an operations, program coordination, or senior administrative role, preferably within a fast-paced technology company.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience managing complex, multi-step processes from start to finish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work cross-functionally and coordinate with multiple internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a partner-facing, channel operations, or sales operations role is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, self-starter mentality with the ability to solve problems on the fly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and customer-focused, with a passion for delivering outstanding experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously with meticulous attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
