&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/DxScXOg6sdY?si=vHjLRv7mEZHa7IEW&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;315&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Pay:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;$&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;20+ per hour&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;232&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;232&quot;&gt;Be the difference. Be BAYADA.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;234&quot; data-end=&quot;548&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is seeking compassionate and dependable Certified Home Health Aides to provide one-on-one care for our clients in Monmouth County. This position offers consistent hours every day of the week, with the flexibility to work part time or build toward a full schedule based on your availability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;550&quot; data-end=&quot;718&quot;&gt;This is an excellent opportunity for caregivers who value consistency, meaningful client relationships, and the ability to make a real impact through personalized care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;720&quot; data-end=&quot;740&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;720&quot; data-end=&quot;740&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;742&quot; data-end=&quot;1144&quot;&gt;• Provide personal care and assistance with daily living activities&lt;br data-start=&quot;809&quot; data-end=&quot;812&quot;&gt;• Support the client’s morning routine, comfort, and safety&lt;br data-start=&quot;871&quot; data-end=&quot;874&quot;&gt;• Assist with mobility, transfers, and personal care needs&lt;br data-start=&quot;932&quot; data-end=&quot;935&quot;&gt;• Follow an individualized care plan and monitor for changes in condition&lt;br data-start=&quot;1008&quot; data-end=&quot;1011&quot;&gt;• Maintain a clean, respectful, and supportive care environment&lt;br data-start=&quot;1074&quot; data-end=&quot;1077&quot;&gt;• Communicate effectively with BAYADA’s clinical and office teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1146&quot; data-end=&quot;1173&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1146&quot; data-end=&quot;1173&quot;&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1175&quot; data-end=&quot;1484&quot;&gt;• Active New Jersey Home Health Aide certification&lt;br data-start=&quot;1225&quot; data-end=&quot;1228&quot;&gt;• Availability for shifts on one or more days per week&lt;br data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1309&quot;&gt;• Reliable, punctual, and committed to consistent care&lt;br data-start=&quot;1363&quot; data-end=&quot;1366&quot;&gt;• Compassionate and patient focused approach&lt;br data-start=&quot;1410&quot; data-end=&quot;1413&quot;&gt;• Experience with personal care or willingness to learn with training&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1486&quot; data-end=&quot;1527&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1486&quot; data-end=&quot;1527&quot;&gt;Why You Will Love Working With BAYADA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1529&quot; data-end=&quot;1907&quot;&gt;• Competitive pay starting at $20 per hour and higher based on experience&lt;br data-start=&quot;1602&quot; data-end=&quot;1605&quot;&gt;• Consistent daily schedule with flexible day selection&lt;br data-start=&quot;1660&quot; data-end=&quot;1663&quot;&gt;• One on one care so you can focus fully on your client&lt;br data-start=&quot;1718&quot; data-end=&quot;1721&quot;&gt;• Paid training and ongoing clinical support&lt;br data-start=&quot;1765&quot; data-end=&quot;1768&quot;&gt;• Opportunities to expand your schedule with additional cases&lt;br data-start=&quot;1829&quot; data-end=&quot;1832&quot;&gt;• A trusted organization built on Compassion, Excellence, and Reliability&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1909&quot; data-end=&quot;2088&quot;&gt;At BAYADA, our caregivers are the heart of everything we do. Whether you are seeking part time hours or looking to grow your schedule, we offer the support and stability you need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2090&quot; data-end=&quot;2169&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2090&quot; data-end=&quot;2169&quot;&gt;Join BAYADA and make a difference in the Monmouth County community. Apply today.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;As an accredited, regulated, certified, and licensed home health care provider, BAYADA complies with all state/local mandates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
