&lt;li&gt;New increased hourly compensation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$650 Health Benefit Stipend: Eligibility for the Health Benefit Stipend requires a continuous commitment of 30 hours a week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No insurance headaches. No clawbacks. No payment delays. We handle everything — you get paid weekly for every session. Ai documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
